WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.360
Hi my name is Donna and I'm a mother of three. I was going through really tough

00:05.360 --> 00:10.560
times because not only do I work full-time at a very demanding job but I

00:10.560 --> 00:16.160
also have to take care of my kids. One of them even has special needs so I needed

00:16.160 --> 00:20.240
something that would help me. I was very stressed. I was having panic attacks. I

00:20.240 --> 00:25.880
didn't know what to do and so I was very happy and grateful to have met Shree.

00:25.880 --> 00:30.920
Shree helped me get the root cause of what was causing my panic attacks, what

00:30.920 --> 00:36.440
was causing my stress and it has changed my life immensely. Now I am calm, I'm

00:36.440 --> 00:42.880
collected, I can actually stop and think before I was just on the go and I was

00:42.880 --> 00:48.200
just running a mile a minute and it was crazy. My life has changed drastically.

00:48.200 --> 00:55.200
Shree has taught me the ways to calm down and you know just take things in in a

00:55.200 --> 00:59.480
way that's peaceful and calm and it's made my life so much better. I'm a better

00:59.480 --> 01:05.920
mom, I'm a better worker because of it and my job. I mean so much has changed. So

01:05.920 --> 01:13.120
thank you so much Shree. I highly highly recommend his coaching and the advice

01:13.120 --> 01:17.280
he gives and he's changed my life so thank you so much Shree. I highly

01:17.280 --> 01:22.360
recommend him. If you're going through what I was going through.

